# Session scratch notes an agent may drop here — never part of the repository
scratchpad/

# Per-machine Claude Code settings (enabled plugins and the like). Written into the checkout by the tool
# itself, so without this it turns up untracked in every status and rides along on the next `git add -A`.
.claude/
